is filled with unsettling sights, eerie sounds, hidden paths, and mysterious secrets waiting to be discovered.\n\nUse fast VR movement to navigate through haunting locations, escape terrifying encounters, and uncover the truth behind the world around you. Whether you're exploring alone or playing with friends, every session offers a unique mix of exploration, suspense, and horror.\n\nFeatures:\n\u2022 Immersive dreamcore-inspired environments\n\u2022 Creepy horror encounters and unsettling atmosphere\n\u2022 Hidden secrets and easter eggs to discover\n\u2022 Smooth VR locomotion built for fast movement\n\u2022 Multiplayer fun with friends\n\u2022 Frequent updates with new maps, features, and content\n\nCan you survive the dream... or will it become your nightmare?\n", "short_description": "Enter a strange dream where nothing feels quite right. Explore eerie environments, uncover hidden secrets, and survive the horrors that lurk in the unknown. Every step takes you deeper into the nightmare.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1n0TJiyRsthl7SvqrudKfrCM8msCaT7PcpYk6niVMkfM/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CrunkStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ethandwiz32.github.io/glitch-vr-website/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_in